# 💬 OPIc Expression - Day27

## Today's Expression

### The problem was that...

Meaning:

문제는 ~였어요.

---

## When to Use

문제 상황이나 예상치 못한 상황을 설명할 때 사용한다.

특히 OPIc에서

- 여행 문제
- 예약 문제
- 교통 문제
- 물건 문제
- 일정 변경
- 일상적인 문제

를 설명할 때 유용하다.

---

## Examples

The problem was that I had the wrong address.

The problem was that the restaurant was already closed.

The problem was that I couldn't find my reservation.

---

## Useful Patterns

### The problem was that + 문장

The problem was that I didn't have enough time.

The problem was that the bus was already full.

---

